# DESCRIPTION: Custom Nintendo Switch / NS2 rules for Surge. Use with extended-matching in RULE-SET to match TLS SNI / HTTP Host.

# Nintendo D4C / ATUM service and download SNI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,d4c.srv.nintendo.net

# Broader Nintendo service SNI fallback
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,srv.nintendo.net

# Nintendo official domains
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nintendo.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nintendo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nintendo.jp
